<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>404 — {{ site_title }}</title>
<style>
  body { font: 16px/1.55 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
         margin: 0 auto; max-width: 46rem; padding: 2rem 1.25rem 4rem; color: #16191d; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
  footer { border-top: 1px solid #d8dce3; margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 0.75rem;
           color: #5b6270; font-size: 0.85rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>404 — not found</h1>
<p>There is no page at this address. Catalogue URLs are cited by
specifications and stay stable across releases; if a link here is broken,
that is a bug worth reporting.</p>
<p><a href="/">Start at the catalogues landing page</a>{% for catalogue in catalogues %},
  or go straight to <a href="{{ catalogue.href }}">{{ catalogue.title }}</a>{% endfor %}.</p>
<footer>{{ stamp }}</footer>
</body>
</html>
